[00:00.00][by:Canopeee]
[00:26.73]Heavy hung the canopy of blue
[00:26.73]蓝色苍穹沉沉欲陷
[00:33.24]Shade my eyes and I can see you
[00:33.24]我眯起眼朝你望去
[00:39.76]White is the light that shines through the dress that you wore
[00:39.76]那日光作衣宛如白练曳地
[00:52.04]She lay in the shadow of the wave
[00:52.04]她仿佛也消融在涛尖碎影
[00:58.94]Hazy were the visions of her playing
[00:58.94]偶尔绰姿隐现
[01:05.17]Sunlight on her eyes but moonshine beat her blind everytime
[01:05.17]阳光向来爱抚她的眼帘 月光却任她啜泣心事
[01:18.14]Green is the colour of her kind
[01:18.14]我仍旧羡慕她
[01:24.52]Quickness of the eye deceives the mind
[01:24.52]浮光掠影系心之所戚
[01:30.88]Envy is the bond between the hopefull and the damned
[01:30.88]向生汲死也悬之一念
